&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;📌 Pin Configuration&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="-pin-configuration"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#-pin-configuration" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
